{
    "uid": "marketplace-red",
    "title": "Marketplace — RED",
    "description": "Three panels for the three questions RED asks: how many, how many failed, how fast. Rate and Errors come from one counter, Duration from a histogram, because a quantile of a Summary cannot be aggregated across instances.",
    "tags": ["marketplace", "red"],
    "timezone": "browser",
    "schemaVersion": 39,
    "version": 1,
    "refresh": "10s",
    "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
    "templating": { "list": [] },
    "panels": [
        {
            "id": 1,
            "type": "timeseries",
            "title": "Rate — how many requests",
            "description": "R of RED. rate() over a one-minute window rather than five: a demo that runs for ninety seconds never fills a five-minute window, and the panel stays flat for a reason that has nothing to do with the service.",
            "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "marketplace-prometheus" },
            "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
            "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "min": 0 },
                "overrides": []
            },
            "targets": [
                {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "marketplace-prometheus" },
                    "editorMode": "code",
                    "range": true,
                    "legendFormat": "{{route}}",
                    "expr": "sum by (route) (rate(http_requests_total[1m]))"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": 2,
            "type": "timeseries",
            "title": "Errors — how many failed",
            "description": "E of RED, and the filter is 5xx on purpose. A 4xx is the client being refused — a 422 on a replayed Idempotency-Key is this service working exactly as designed — while a 5xx is this service failing. Counting them together makes the panel useless the first time somebody fuzzes the API.",
            "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "marketplace-prometheus" },
            "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
            "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "min": 0 },
                "overrides": []
            },
            "targets": [
                {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "marketplace-prometheus" },
                    "editorMode": "code",
                    "range": true,
                    "legendFormat": "{{route}} {{status}}",
                    "expr": "sum by (route, status) (rate(http_requests_total{status=~\"5..\"}[1m]))"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": 3,
            "type": "timeseries",
            "title": "Duration — how fast (p95, p99)",
            "description": "D of RED. histogram_quantile interpolates inside a bucket, so the answer is as precise as the bucket boundaries are — and it cannot see past the last finite le at all. If p99 ever sits exactly on the top boundary, the panel is not healthy, it is blind: add buckets.",
            "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "marketplace-prometheus" },
            "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
            "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": { "unit": "s", "min": 0 },
                "overrides": []
            },
            "targets": [
                {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "marketplace-prometheus" },
                    "editorMode": "code",
                    "range": true,
                    "legendFormat": "p95 {{route}}",
                    "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, route) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[1m])))"
                },
                {
                    "refId": "B",
                    "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "marketplace-prometheus" },
                    "editorMode": "code",
                    "range": true,
                    "legendFormat": "p99 {{route}}",
                    "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, route) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[1m])))"
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
